[plugins] RelayMind rejected the stored application token (HTTP 401 unauthenticated). The gateway generates a new application token every time it starts, so a restart makes the stored one stale. Copy the token the running `relaymind serve` printed and store it with `openclaw models auth paste-api-key --provider relaymind`.
